    "text": {
     "en": "After school Navya sees her grandfather at the gate. “Dada ji, let us take the market route today!” she says.\nThey walk to the bus stop and board a bus. Navya sits by the window.\nShe sees a red postbox on the corner. Dada ji says she can write a letter and post it there.\nDada ji used to write letters to his brother in another city. The postman took them to the post office, where letters were sorted by region and sent.\nA post office offers other services too.\nActivity: write a letter to a friend and post it."
    }
